                      "description": "Job Description\n\"\nLicensed Psychiatric Nurse Practitioner \\n\n\\n Wage: Up to $189/hour\n\\n Did you know that you can build a flexible private …",
                      "description_html": "<h3> Job Description </h3><p><p>&quot;</p><b> Licensed Psychiatric Nurse Practitioner </b>\\n <p>&#160;</p>\\n <p><b> Wage: Up to $189/hour </…",
